<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark May 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark May 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank and Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    02.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    24.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING  DUESSELDORF PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.175     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND APR.03 TREUHAND -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
